ZAP scanning report generated 30 September 2026
The ZAP report covered 11 endpoints and recorded nine alert records in its risk summary: four Medium, four Low, and one Informational, with no High-risk ZAP alerts. Manual testing was still necessary because access-control and business-logic flaws depend on application context that an automated scanner cannot reliably infer.
